Vela name and marks
===================

The Vela name, sail, wordmark, and lockups are trademark rights reserved. They
are not licensed under the repository's Apache-2.0 OR MIT code license.

`vela-logo-wordmark.svg` is a public delivery copy of the locked Vela sail and
outlined wordmark maintained by the governed brand package in
`vela-science/vela-web`. Its geometry comes from the canonical SVG source; the
paper field is a GitHub-readable presentation layer for light and dark themes.

`vela-readme-hero.jpg` uses that exact sail and wordmark over a non-authoritative
editorial cartography backdrop. It contains no repository data or scientific
claim. The foreground copy and identity were composed deterministically; the
background plate was generated for this presentation asset.

`vela-state-flow.svg` is a deterministic explanatory diagram. It describes the
released product boundary but is not a protocol schema or scientific record.

Do not redesign or reinterpret the sail in this repository. Brand changes are
made at the canonical source, verified against its export manifest, and then
synced here as a release asset.
